  "industry_note": "UNS G11440 / SAE 1144 / DIN 1.1241 — resulfurized free-machining medium-carbon steel (C 0.40-0.48, Mn 1.35-1.65, S 0.24-0.33). 'Stressproof' = LaSalle Steel 의 cold-drawn + stress-relieved 변종. Cold drawn (TG&P): σy 690 / UTS 830 / HB 200. 가공 후 dimensional 안정 (low residual stress). 자동차 shaft, gear, 산업 machinery 부품, threaded fastener — wherever machinability 가 critical.",
